# Game Objects Directory

This folder will contain entity classes:
- Ball.js - Ball physics and rendering
- Flipper.js - Flipper mechanics
- Bumper.js - Bumper behavior
- Target.js - Drop targets
- Kicker.js - Kicker/slingshot
- Wall.js - Wall segments
- Ramp.js - Ramps

See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md for entity pattern.
